{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Edible ham might help erase memories of walking ham.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:28:46.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868771749691535381","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...in theory, but...' she sighs. 'I know you said I shouldn't compare myself to that. But it would feel... wrong.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:29:30.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868771934509359155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"No, I'd say it's comparing yourself to it that feels wrong.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:35:40.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868773487928549416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...it's difficult not to. You saw what I was like before.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:36:15.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868773632502018108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Yeah, and didn't really see any problem. Still just as much of a person as everyone else or you now, and you didn't go mad and put everyone in danger. Besides, even before that you were still a person. That thing, I don't think so.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:49:27.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868776954617294858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'...I might have done without help. When Kukudh...' she shakes her head. 'No. You're right, I think. I'd still like to discuss the whole situation with Mender later, I'm still... slightly conflicted about ending its misery... but I'll try to not worry. Thank you.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:51:42.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868777521322278942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I don't think it really should've actually been alive like that in the first place. If Sonny's spell hadn't worked, I would've just shot it. And then it still turned out *he* wanted it gone. It was a failed experiment that put the town in danger, not a person.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:58:28.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868779225870639135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'I suppose. I just feel bad for it, being brought into the world in such pain... It wasn't its fault.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T08:59:28.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868779477436620811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"'Ending its misery was the best option for everyone involved, perhaps except *him*, but...' she shrugs. 'I don't know. I agree with you, but that small scrap of personhood makes me worry.'","created_at":"2021-07-25T09:01:32.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868779999220621333","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
